                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "47b2359a-3fbf-4b24-8b6c-7ab4a885f19a",
                        "entry_id": "de4fe197-358c-3db5-b6fd-5e6515278bde",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "incantatoires"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d5dfd4b5-f488-333d-b548-88b718b798fb",
                        "entry_id": "de4fe197-358c-3db5-b6fd-5e6515278bde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à une action de magie ou de sorcellerie."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "88fb1f72-cc18-46e6-b0c7-750be8c7b5bc",
                                "sense_id": "d5dfd4b5-f488-333d-b548-88b718b798fb",
                                "text": "La présence très fréquente d’incisions parallèles ou de lignes de ponctuation à proximité des figures d’animaux dans les grottes décorées autorise à considérer qu’elles peuvent avoir été tracées au cours d’un processus incantatoire."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f71effe-5d62-4eb5-b7b3-627827ced522",
                                "sense_id": "d5dfd4b5-f488-333d-b548-88b718b798fb",
                                "text": "La croyance populaire prête à la hart de coudrier des vertus magiques semblables è celles qui sont associées à la poule noire, un objet incantatoire servant à échanger le salut éternel de son âme pour obtenir de l’argent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "730390a8-0b19-46ba-965c-7fe62f091b94",
                                "sense_id": "d5dfd4b5-f488-333d-b548-88b718b798fb",
                                "text": "Litanie incantatoire."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f452bfd6-8019-3379-a68e-f94389e5d775",
                        "entry_id": "de4fe197-358c-3db5-b6fd-5e6515278bde",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Relatif à un souhait ou un vœu ; sans effet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "35bb3368-4d4e-46a9-875d-7b0a9446763d",
                                "sense_id": "f452bfd6-8019-3379-a68e-f94389e5d775",
                                "text": "La taxe sur la fortune des milliardaires, portée par le président Lula et soutenue notamment par la France, est restée au stade incantatoire. Le G20 a certes convenu que l’efficacité de l’imposition des super-riches devait être améliorée, mais il s’est limité à des positions de principe sur l’échange d’informations et le nécessaire débat sur l’évasion fiscale : aucune ébauche de réforme n’a été lancée."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "32a5959a-c4d3-45e2-a221-321daa6a5002",
                        "source_entry_id": "de4fe197-358c-3db5-b6fd-5e6515278bde",
                        "target_lang_word": "incantatory",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incantatory",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37ae3764-72ff-3476-9e9f-e1e997a860dc",
                                        "entry_id": "613fbd82-2746-3904-9f57-ceee35f8179e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Constituting, employing, dealing with, or suitable for use in incantation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "919a94fa-01a8-475c-925a-49c82a1c3d07",
                                                "sense_id": "37ae3764-72ff-3476-9e9f-e1e997a860dc",
                                                "text": "Fortune tellers, Juglers, Geomancers, and the like incantatory impostors, though commonly men of inferiour rank, and from whom without illumination they can expect no more then from themselves, do daily and professedly delude them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ec28c10-31ac-4a5e-8122-60f86b5e32ef",
                                                "sense_id": "37ae3764-72ff-3476-9e9f-e1e997a860dc",
                                                "text": "1888, Lafcadio Hearn, “A Midsummer Trip to the West Indies,” Second Paper, XIII, Harper’s New Monthly Magazine, Volume 77, Number 459, August 1888, p. 332,\nA trained musician might protest against so strange a manner of ringing the chimes; but he could not possibly deny that it has impressiveness: it is wild, barbaric, incantatory—it is a monstrous musical conjuration."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7db0e18-909a-4ba7-855c-17ada1aa198d",
                                                "sense_id": "37ae3764-72ff-3476-9e9f-e1e997a860dc",
                                                "text": "Thenceforward the witch without a name held continuous receptions in the boudoir, and the boudoir gradually grew into an abode of mystery and strangeness, hypnotizing the entire house. People went thither; people came back; and those who had not been pictured to themselves something very incantatory, and little by little they made up their minds to go."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f4dacac-c570-360c-b7a3-3e2d8f1290e4",
                                        "entry_id": "613fbd82-2746-3904-9f57-ceee35f8179e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Resembling incantation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "172a8264-dccb-473d-bcae-2bba7fe16756",
                                                "sense_id": "3f4dacac-c570-360c-b7a3-3e2d8f1290e4",
                                                "text": "The film's most persistent (and pernicious) image is of a train, clanking and rambling down a track. Again and again and again, down the track to Auschwitz. It is incantatory; the trains exude evil, huff and grind down the track, very slowly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ae308bf9-85b7-4d73-af31-dcba5423e6be",
                        "source_entry_id": "de4fe197-358c-3db5-b6fd-5e6515278bde",
